                                          <h2 class="large_text_double_extra_large emphatic_typeface ten_point_leading tight_letter_spacing smoky_gray_text">Frequently asked questions</h2>
                                          <p class="top_margin_six standard_text_base seven_point_leading dark_gray_text">
                                                 Choosing an interior design approach often begins with practical questions about the brief, the rooms involved and how decisions will be made. The answers below offer general information about discussing a residential interior with Daylight Room Co. Project details, available services, timing and any applicable terms should be confirmed directly before work begins, as no specific scope or arrangement is assumed here.
                                          </p>
