                                          <dl class="vertical_space_sixteen sm_matrix sm_two_grid_columns sm_horizontal_gap_six sm_vertical_gap_sixteen sm_vertical_space_zero lg_horizontal_gap_ten">
                                                 <div>
                                                        <dt class="standard_text_base semi_bold_typeface seven_point_leading smoky_gray_text">What kinds of spaces does Daylight Room Co. focus on?</dt>
                                                        <dd class="top_margin_two standard_text_base seven_point_leading dark_gray_text">Daylight Room Co. focuses on interior design for residential spaces. You can describe the room or home you have in mind when you get in touch, so the suitability and possible scope can be discussed.</dd>
                                                 </div>
                                                 <div>
                                                        <dt class="standard_text_base semi_bold_typeface seven_point_leading smoky_gray_text">What should I include in an initial enquiry?</dt>
                                                        <dd class="top_margin_two standard_text_base seven_point_leading dark_gray_text">Share which room or rooms you are considering, what you would like to change, how the space is used and any preferences or practical needs that should inform the design. You can also mention questions you would like to discuss.</dd>
                                                 </div>
                                                 <div>
                                                        <dt class="standard_text_base semi_bold_typeface seven_point_leading smoky_gray_text">Do I need to have a style decided before contacting you?</dt>
                                                        <dd class="top_margin_two standard_text_base seven_point_leading dark_gray_text">No. You can start with a general feeling, a few references, practical concerns or simply a description of what is not working. The conversation can help clarify priorities and explore a visual direction that suits the home and your preferences.</dd>
                                                 </div>
                                                 <div>
                                                        <dt class="standard_text_base semi_bold_typeface seven_point_leading smoky_gray_text">Can you confirm project scope and timing in advance?</dt>
                                                        <dd class="top_margin_two standard_text_base seven_point_leading dark_gray_text">The scope and timing depend on the details of the project and should be discussed directly before any work begins. Contact Daylight Room Co. with an outline of your needs to ask what may be appropriate; no specific schedule or outcome is assumed.</dd>
                                                 </div>
                                          </dl>
                                   </div>
                            </div>
